  "articles": [
    {
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "The pattern of these sentences is\n\nइस देश का नाम ( X ) है ।    The name of this country is ( X ).\n\n\nExamples:\n\nइस देश का नाम चीन है ।    The name of this country is China.\nइस देश का नाम रूस है ।    The name of this country is Russia.\nइस देश का नाम बर्मा है ।    The name of this country is Burma.\nइस देश का नाम पाकिस्तान है ।    The name of this country is Pakistan.\nइस देश का नाम भारत है ।    The name of this country is India.\n\n\nThe question fits this pattern:\n\nइस देश का नाम क्या है ?    What is the name of this country?\n\n\nदेश country may be omitted:\n\nइस का नाम क्या है ?    What is its name?\n\n\nनाम name may also be left out, if the meaning is clear without it.\n\n\nऔर इस का ?    And this?\n\n\nUseful expressions:\n\nजी हाँ ।    Yes.\nजी नहीं ।    No.\n"
    }
  ],
